    "body": "> Thanks, it seems that @zcorpan asked some questions in [#11874 (comment)](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11874#issuecomment-3551804358) that probably need to be answered. I'll defer to him as to how to move this forward.\r\n\r\nThis PR is a bare minimum to enable disabled JS emulation for WebDriver BiDi users and enable some scripting. Regardless of the discussions in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11874 outcome, this PR still seem to make sense.",
