    "updated_at": "2025-11-24T09:06:25Z",
    "body": "> do you plan on enforcing the limitations related to this PR for Chrome or are you waiting until we get an agreement for #11441 to do any implementation changes?\r\n\r\nWe don't plan to implement this limited version. However, I believe this part is not controversial, as long as current browsers implementation supports all the positive scenarios defined in this PR. So we can merge this and continue discussion in the issue and the other PR on how to align all the rest details.",
