    "updated_at": "2025-11-24T10:13:49Z",
    "body": "> We don't plan to implement this limited version.\r\n\r\nI think it would be better to go directly to the desired end state that matches what is implemented. Per the \"don't write fiction\" rule in our [working mode](https://whatwg.org/working-mode), it seems to me we should land #11441 instead. We can still make changes, so long as implementations are able to make changes.",
